Cell["\<\
The purpose of this MICA Module is to define Hammerstein systems and \
introduce techniques which under certain circumstances enables Hammerstein \
systems to be characterized experimentally.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.783699896829513*^9, 3.783699993001296*^9}, {
   3.783712681773767*^9, 3.7837126865070486`*^9}, 3.783767029013916*^9, {
