Cell["\<\
In this MICA Notebook we will simulate a Hammerstein system and attempt to \
discover,  n(\[CenterDot]) and h(\[Tau]), purely from the input, x(t), and \
output, y(t), data sets.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7837001774699593`*^9, 3.783700645586067*^9}, {
   3.783712731510212*^9, 3.783712788064506*^9}, 3.783719425377431*^9, {
   3.784056238406757*^9, 3.7840562979413643`*^9}, {3.784064469930166*^9, 
   3.784064550675981*^9}, {3.784064596029889*^9, 3.784064673241288*^9}, {
