Cell["\<\
The fitted function is similar to the actual Hammerstein system nonlinearity.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7842297487943764`*^9, 3.784229806413586*^9}, {
  3.784233714765119*^9, 3.784233726816381*^9}, {3.784236551633102*^9, 
