Cell["\<\
Now that we have a new estimate, u4(t), we can predict the form of the static \
nonlinearity by simply cross-plotting x vs u4 :\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.783718378302371*^9, 3.783718469262151*^9}, {
  3.784204219663159*^9, 3.784204225429484*^9}, {3.784230200633982*^9, 
