Cell["\<\
Now lets plot the parametric impulse response function with these estimates \
together with the nonparametric impulse response function, h3(\[Tau]):\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.780520714079507*^9, 3.780520769869465*^9}, {
  3.783996075819119*^9, 3.7839961186556582`*^9}, {3.784235441312168*^9, 
