Cell["\<\
Our initial estimates are clearly off. Lets estimate the four parameters \
using our trusty Levenberg-Marquardt nonlinear minimization technique:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.784035997514586*^9, 3.784036056732134*^9}, {
  3.784734487675997*^9, 
  3.784734488273294*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ceb5da1e-5b95-4a29-bcfb-\
